        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "id": "Velocity",
          "title": "Velocity",
          "shows": "The four inputs of sales velocity, each against last period: open opportunities, average value, win rate and cycle length. The input that moved most shows where the pipeline is stuck."
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "id": "Opportunity table",
          "title": "Opportunity table",
          "shows": "One table of opportunities with owner, Rockfon value or “unknown”, created date, last update, next action and due date. Sort by last updated, newest or biggest. Show won and lost with their reasons. The two coaching opportunities are pinned at the top; a missing next step and a stalled opportunity are flagged in the row."
        }
      ]
    },
